# Prettier formats the code (JS, TS, Astro, CSS) and the data and config files (JSON, YAML): `npm run format`
# writes it, `npm run lint` checks it. ESLint and Stylelint check everything else (neither has a formatting rule
# switched on). Markdown, HTML and SVG stay out: the Markdown is hand-wrapped prose, the HTML and SVG are written by
# scripts (tools/gen_*.py, the build). tools/office_parts/ is a generator's input: a {{pal:NAME}} template pasted into
# the drawings as it is, so its bytes are the drawing's (python tools/regen.py --check).
